<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab gunmen ambushed a road construction team on the Arabia-Lafey road in Mandera, Kenya, killing two National Police Reservists and five civilian workers, and also attacked a security escort vehicle in the same area, causing further fatalities. Somali Danab commandos launched security operations in Middle Shabelle targeting Al-Shabaab extortion networks. US forces carried out overnight airstrikes against ISIS positions in Puntland, Somalia. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQdk1XU216eUFxRzdTN0dUMl9tejJwcEhMMUNaZ0NEUFkybGN4cWQ2blY4VjREakhMVnJhY3hCdUZzdEN3TDV1cENrTmY0Z25TM1NTVHY0Z0VoU2dBV0ZNaGxVUTlsRFRwaTVXM3BFSmhuNnA2LTY0UUV3QVE3V0NOSXZ1TmdXcGYwSkxTSjVaeHY1S21zVW5WU19MOFE5Vmg5dkdUcFZaUXA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE14Q3FZZTFkMDk2SnRlbGd6M0E0VFdHd1J5Rm9tb1RTNXdkYnhfWURFN1BHb2MzeUxOVF9MdHJKY3NoUVdBTFExYkJiSnZDWlZDd2JEQkVVS3VmRHRzWkhlVzZDRUpyQkFmUlhWZXVhQXBqbXFjeUZDSERELWZEZUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPZER6Rm9LQlJoVEd1NmxMSHVQY2Mwd3l6ZFIxVk9yZGpub3N0Vk1YOV9YMzBRZ3Z5RHFubXdEbnd2bFJPZnUxVlEwSXc0T2tZQVBLUktfOEdtV1pIUVpfNERDLVEtbnZuRVlBMHVFN2FjMk16ZDI1cjBzMF9MZmF3SjM1NnlMSlZRT2t6bDc4bXN3eHI5VjE3QzVWWGwwN1BEeHpHXw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxObWRsbDRyV2UyaV9WMHRxSGFDeWdQcXNhRUNoN01PYjhXQ1RDcnUwTlVvX0xBdG5wT3RiX2d3NWtYREdhUVlfS1FjSV9BcWRDVG1nRUNOYkZmMEdXTkd5ZS1qTnYtdkxfVlI5Y1d0aTFNSDVwTGEzZnR4bkwyOUhkdDd0RE1hcWFaQ2VvckVrOS04RG9QMmJ5ZXBXcWVaT1ZCancxY1pLeFM5Y2VjWGJZZzBiNEt0aDdZdkZVQWdyMTNydw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Shabelle Media Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a hre